  "description": "The Stereo 120 Pro sets the standard for trail riding performance and reliability. From the smooth, effortless trail-taming potential of our proven four bar suspension system to the rock solid dependability of Shimano's 2x11 transmission, everything about this bike is designed to help you get the most out of your trail riding adventures. For 2018 we've even specced RockShox's Judy Silver TK air fork with 32mm stanchions for extra steering precision on the roughest of descents. It all adds up to pure riding pleasure, whether you're getting your kicks on twisty trail centre singletrack or on a multi-day Alpine epic.",
